          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><br /><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hello,&nbsp;<br /><br /> Thank you for considering Zeta Charter Schools for your family!&nbsp;<br /><br /> Zeta is a public charter school network that provides a tuition-free, pre-K through high school journey in the Bronx, Manhattan, and Queens. Our whole-child approach combines rigorous academics, expert-led Specialty classes, and a joyful community where students are known and loved. At Zeta, students discover their strengths and passions as they prepare for college and beyond.<br /><br /><strong>We are happy to share that the applications for the 2027-2028 school year are open.</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/s/login/SelfRegister?locale=us"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Apply today</span></span></a><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> to a Zeta school in your neighborhood.<br /><br /> To learn more about our next-generation approach to education and your preferred school, </span></span><a href="https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">register for an upcoming event.</span></span></a><br /><br /><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Meanwhile, If you have any questions, please reach out at enroll@zetaschools.org or call us at (646) 480-1654.&nbsp;<br /><br /> Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team&nbsp;</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools<br /><span style="color:#dddddd;">___________________________</span></span></span><br /> &nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hola,<br /><br /> ¡Gracias por considerar Zeta Charter Schools para tu familia!<br /><br /> Zeta es una red de escuelas chárter públicas que ofrece una trayectoria educativa gratuita, desde pre-K hasta la escuela secundaria, en el Bronx, Manhattan y Queens. Nuestro enfoque integral combina un riguroso nivel académico, clases especiales dirigidas por expertos y una comunidad alegre donde los estudiantes son conocidos y queridos. En Zeta, los estudiantes descubren sus fortalezas y pasiones mientras se preparan para la universidad y más allá.<br /><br /><strong>Nos complace anunciar que las aplicaciones para el año escolar 2027-2028 están abiertas.&nbsp;</strong><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/s/login/SelfRegister?locale=us">Aplique hoy</a> a una escuela Zeta en su vecindario.<br /><br /> Para obtener más información sobre nuestro enfoque educativo de próxima generación y su escuela preferida, <a href="https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/">regístrese en un próximo evento</a>.<br /><br /> Mientras tanto, si tiene alguna pregunta, comuníquese con nosotros a enroll@zetaschools.org o llámenos al (646) 480-1654.<br /><br /> Atentamente,<br /><strong>El equipo de admisiones de Zeta</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools</span><br /><span style="color:#dddddd;">___________________________</span><br /> &nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">您好，<br /><br /> 感谢您的家庭考虑 Zeta 特许学校！<br /><br /> Zeta 是一个公立特许学校教育网络，在布朗克斯、曼哈顿和皇后区提供从学前班到高中的免费教育。我们秉持全人教育理念，将扎实的学术课程、由专业教师授课的特色课程，以及充满欢乐与关爱的校园氛围融为一体，让每位学生都被了解、被关爱。在 Zeta，学生能够发现自己的优势与热爱，为升入大学及未来的发展做好准备。<br /><br /> 我们很高兴地和您分享，2027-2028学年的申请现已开放。<br /><br /><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/s/login/SelfRegister?locale=us">立即申请您所在社区的 Zeta 学校</a>。<br /><br /> 要详细了解我们的教育方法以及您心仪的学校，<a href="https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/">请注册参加即将举行的活动</a> 。<br /><br /> 同时，如果您有任何疑问，请通过 enroll@zetaschools.org 与我们联系，或致电 (646) 480-1654。<br /><br /> 谨此问候，<br /><strong>Zeta 招生团队</strong><br /> Zeta 特许学校</span></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
